			</section>
			
            <section>
                <div class="section-inner" style="padding-top: 0 !important;">
                    <h2 class="text-center">Commitment on low-cost and no-cost accounts</h2>
                    <p class="text-center">The RBC Day to Day Banking account is offered as part of our low-cost and no-cost account commitment to the Canadian consumers<sup><a href="#legal-dasterisk" class="scrollto">**</a></sup>.</p>
                </div>
            </section>

			<section id="faqs" aria-label="FAQs">

				<div class="section-inner flex flex-direction-column flex-align-center pad-b-0">

					<h2 class="text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

					<div class="accordion mar-b-0 faq-content mar-t-dbl w-100">

						<div class="grid-wpr eh-wpr same-height-boxes" data-box="accordion-panel" data-collapsible="true">

							<div class="grid-half">

								<div class="accordion-panel">

									<button data-target="#accordion1" class="collapse-toggle collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion1" aria-expanded="false">
										What is the RBC Day to Day banking account?
									</button>

									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion1" aria-expanded="false" style="height: 0px">

										<div class="collapse-inner">
											<p>RBC Day to Day Banking is a chequing account that provides 12 debit transactions each month<sup><a href="#legal-8" class="scrollto">8</a></sup>, unlimited e-transfers<sup><a href="#legal-34" class="scrollto">34</a></sup>and more, with a low monthly fee of $4<sup><a href="#legal-1" class="scrollto">1</a>,<a href="#legal-31" class="scrollto">31</a></sup>, and as low as $0<sup><a href="#legal-2" class="scrollto">2</a></sup> with the Value Program Rebate.</p>

										</div>

									</div>

								</div>

								<div class="accordion-panel">

									<button data-target="#accordion2" class="collapse-toggle collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion2" aria-expanded="false">
										Is the RBC Day to Day bank account a no fee account?
									</button>

									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion2" aria-expanded="false" style="height: 0px">

										<div class="collapse-inner">

											<p>The RBC Day to Day Baking account is a low-fee account, with the standard monthly fee of $4. However, you may be eligible to receive a full rebate on your monthly fee through the Value Program Rebate<sup><a href="#legal-2" class="scrollto">2</a></sup>, the Seniors Rebate<sup><a href="#legal-7" class="scrollto">7</a>,<a href="#legal-31" class="scrollto">31</a></sup>, as an Indigenous person<sup><a href="#legal-31" class="scrollto">31</a>,<a href="#legal-33" class="scrollto">33</a></sup>, or as an RDSP beneficiary.<sup><a href="#legal-6" class="scrollto">6</a>,<a href="#legal-31" class="scrollto">31</a></sup></p>

										</div>

									</div>

								</div>

								<div class="accordion-panel">

									<button data-target="#accordion3" class="collapse-toggle collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion3" aria-expanded="false">
										Can I receive multiple monthly fee rebates with the RBC Day to Day Banking account?
									</button>

									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion3" aria-expanded="false" style="height: 0px">

										<div class="collapse-inner">
											<p>No. You can only receive one monthly fee rebate per bank account. RBC will automatically apply the highest value rebate you are eligible for each month.</p>
										</div>

									</div>

								</div>

								<div class="accordion-panel">

									<button data-target="#accordion4" class="collapse-toggle collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion4" aria-expanded="false">
										What happens when I no longer qualify for a rebate?
									</button>

									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion4" aria-expanded="false" style="height: 0px">

										<div class="collapse-inner">
											<p>
												Once you no longer qualify for any of the available rebates, you will be charged the full monthly fee.
											</p>
										</div>

									</div>

								</div>

								<div class="accordion-panel">

									<button data-target="#accordion6" class="collapse-toggle collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion6" aria-expanded="false">
										How do I open a RBC Day to Day Banking account?
									</button>

									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion6" aria-expanded="false" style="height: 0px">

										<div class="collapse-inner">

											<p>You can open this account online via RBC Online Banking or the RBC Mobile app, or in person at an RBC branch. If you open your account online, RBC may ask you to verify your ID at a branch before activation. </p>

											<p>To apply, you’ll need:</p>

											<ul class="disc-list">

												<li>A valid ID (such as a driver’s licence or passport)</li>

												<li>Your personal information (address, date of birth, email, employment or student status, and tax residency)</li>

											</ul>

										</div>

									</div>

								</div>

								<div class="accordion-panel">

									<button data-target="#accordion7" class="collapse-toggle collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion7" aria-expanded="false">
										What is the RBC Value program and how do I enrol?
									</button>

									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion7" aria-expanded="false" style="height: 0px">

										<div class="collapse-inner">

											<p>The Value Program is a way for RBC clients with an eligible personal bank account to get more rewards and more savings. When you enrol an eligible RBC bank account in the Value Program, you can:</p>

											<ul class="disc-list">
												<li>Save on monthly fees when you:
													<ul class="disc-list">
														<li>Have two or more additional eligible RBC product categories</li>
														<li>Complete at least one account activity each month (direct deposit, an eligible bill payment, or a pre-authorized payment) for each enrolled account.</li>
													</ul>
												</li>
												<li>Earn Avion points when you make debit purchases in-store or online using your enrolled account.</li>
											</ul>

											<p>The best part? There is no additional cost to enrol in the Value Program. You can enrol your RBC Day to Day Banking account by booking an appointment, calling <span class="tel-number">1-800-769-2511</span> or visiting a branch.</p>
										</div>

									</div>

								</div>

							</div>

							<div class="grid-half">

								

								<div class="accordion-panel">

									<button data-target="#accordion8" class="collapse-toggle collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion8" aria-expanded="false">
										What type of transactions are included in my 12 debit transactions?
									</button>

									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion8" aria-expanded="false" style="height: 0px">

										<div class="collapse-inner">

											<p>A debit transaction can include:</p>
											<ul class="disc-list">
												<li>Using your debit card to make purchases in store or online when funds come directly from your bank account</li>
												<li>ATM withdrawals</li>
												<li>Pre-authorized payments that come from your chequing account, such as subscriptions or gym memberships</li>
												<li>Online bill payments</li>
												<li>Automatic transfers</li>
												<li>Point-of-sale purchases, including swiping, inserting, or tapping your card at checkout</li>
												<li>Point-of-sale cash back requested during a debit card purchase</li>
											</ul>
											<p>For a list of debit transactions, refer to the PDA agreement and disclosures (will be hyperlinked)</p>
										</div>

									</div>

								</div>

								<div class="accordion-panel">

									<button data-target="#accordion9" class="collapse-toggle collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion9" aria-expanded="false">
										What happens if I go over my 12 included debit transaction limit?
									</button>

									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion9" aria-expanded="false" style="height: 0px">

										<div class="collapse-inner">

											<p>If you exceed your 12 debits a month, you will be a charged $1.25 for each additional debit transaction.</p>

										</div>

									</div>

								</div>

								<div class="accordion-panel">

									<button data-target="#accordion10" class="collapse-toggle collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion10" aria-expanded="false">
										How does the RBC Day to Day differ from the other chequing accounts?
									</button>

									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion10" aria-expanded="false" style="height: 0px">

										<div class="collapse-inner">

											<p>You can compare chequing accounts to discover key differences and choose what features are right for you.</p>

										</div>

									</div>

								</div>

								<div class="accordion-panel">

									<button data-target="#accordion11" class="collapse-toggle collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion11" aria-expanded="false">
										What is overdraft protection and how do I use it?
									</button>

									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion11" aria-expanded="false" style="height: 0px">

										<div class="collapse-inner">

											<p>Overdraft protection coverage means you won’t pay the usual overdraft protection fee. However, interest still applies on any overdrawn balance until it is repaid.</p>

											<p>Your overdraft limit depends on your credit history and account activity. RBC typically sets personalized limits for eligible clients, and you’ll be notified of your limit when your overdraft protection is approved.</p>
											
										</div>

									</div>

								</div>
								<div class="accordion-panel">

									<button data-target="#accordion12" class="collapse-toggle collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion12" aria-expanded="false">
										What constitutes a public transit transaction?
									</button>

									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion12" aria-expanded="false" style="height: 0px">

										<div class="collapse-inner">

											<p>A public transit transaction is a payment made to use public transportation services, such as buses, subways, trains, streetcars and ferries. This can include tapping your debit card at a subway gate, bus reader, or train station, buying transit tickets or passes, and reloading a transit card.</p>
											
										</div>

									</div>

								</div>
								<div class="accordion-panel">

									<button data-target="#accordion13" class="collapse-toggle collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion13" aria-expanded="false">
										What is a Virtual Visa Debit, and do I get one with my RBC Day to Day Banking Account?
									</button>

									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion13" aria-expanded="false" style="height: 0px">

										<div class="collapse-inner">

											<p>A Virtual Visa Debit card gives you the freedom to pay bills, shop online and shop internationally in-store, using funds directly from your bank account. Your Virtual Visa Debit card is already linked to your account as a free feature. Simply use the RBC Mobile app, give us a call, or visit a branch to get yours today. <a href="https://www.rbcroyalbank.com/banking-services/virtual-visa-debit/index.html">Learn more</a> about your Virtual Visa Debit, including how to request a physical card and add it to your mobile wallet.</p>
											
										</div>

									</div>

								</div>
							</div>

						</div>

					</div>
				</div>

			</section>



			<section aria-label="Disclaimers" id="disclaimer" class="disclaimer">

				<div class="section-inner pad-t-dbl pad-b-dbl">

				

					<p>

						<button id="collapseButton" data-target="#disclaimers" data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="disclaimers" class="collapse-toggle collapsed" data-dig-details="View legal disclaimer - bottom of page" data-dig-id="accounts-IQeDqaGIzN49-25"><span>View Legal Disclaimers</span><span>Hide Legal Disclaimers</span></button>

					</p>



					<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="disclaimers">

						<div class="collapse-inner">

