										In addition to the fee for making a Cross Border Debit, the purchase amount will be subject to foreign exchange rates at the time of the purchase. Transactions are converted to Canadian dollars at an exchange rate that is 2.5% over the Interbank Spot Rate as defined by <em>Interac</em><sup>‡</sup> Corp.


