										The standard Monthly Fee for the RBC Advantage Banking account is $12.95; however, you may be eligible to receive a full or partial rebate on your account's standard Monthly Fee if you meet the criteria applicable to rebates or discounts we offer, as described herein, and in the documents entitled <a target="_blank" class="standalone-pdf" href="/onlinebanking/servicech/pdf/PDA_Account_Disclosure_Booklet.pdf">“Personal Deposit Accounts Disclosures and Agreements”</a>.


